WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.529
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.529 --> 00:00:07.229
Stop gaslighting people!

00:00:07.229 --> 00:00:11.280
Gaslighting is a form of psychological manipulation
where someone deliberately attempts to get

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:16.589
another person to question their perception
of reality, and even their sanity itself.

00:00:16.589 --> 00:00:19.480
In short, it's not a very nice thing to do.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.890
It's especially not nice, or permitted in
any way, for Dr. Bright to attempt to gaslight

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:29.289
various Foundation staff into thinking that
they, in fact, are the real Dr. Bright.

00:00:29.289 --> 00:00:33.780
We're not sure what you're attempting to accomplish
there, Doctor, but it's mean, and we're tired

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.930
of paying for the therapy bills.

